# src/

Onion Architecture — concentric layers where dependencies point inwards:

```
presentation/ → infrastructure/ → application/ → domain/
```

- `domain/` — innermost: pure entities, domain services, repository interfaces
- `application/` — orchestrates domain; depends on ports; no HTTP/database knowledge
- `infrastructure/` — adapters: controllers, ORM repos, messaging publishers
- `presentation/` — NestJS bootstrapping only: app.module + main.ts
- `shared/` — cross-cutting: config, errors, auth, health, database, cache
